  questions:
  - questionId: Mahatma Gandhi
    answer: Mahatma Gandhi
    clue1: I am known as the Father of Our Nation.
    clue2: I led India using non-violence and truth.
    clue3: People also call me Bapu.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Jawaharlal Nehru
    - Subhas Chandra Bose
    - Sardar Patel
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Lion
    answer: Lion
    clue1: I am known as the king of the jungle.
    clue2: I have a strong roar that can be heard from far away.
    clue3: I live in the savanna and lead a pride.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Tiger
    - Leopard
    - Elephant
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Sun
    answer: Sun
    clue1: I rise in the east and set in the west.
    clue2: I give Earth heat and light.
    clue3: Planets move around me.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Moon
    - Star
    - Cloud
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Pencil
    answer: Pencil
    clue1: I help you write and draw.
    clue2: I become shorter when used.
    clue3: I usually have graphite inside me.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Pen
    - Crayon
    - Brush
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Clock
    answer: Clock
    clue1: I have numbers on my face.
    clue2: My hands move all day.
    clue3: I tell you the time.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Calendar
    - Compass
    - Watch
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Taj Mahal
    answer: Taj Mahal
    clue1: I am made of white marble.
    clue2: I stand in Agra.
    clue3: I am a famous monument of love.
    manualWrongOptions:
    - Red Fort
    - Qutub Minar
    - India Gate
    questionSprite: {fileID: 0}
    clueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    correctAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - questionId: Elephant
